# QA Test Strategy V5

## Purpose
Establish comprehensive automated and manual testing protocols for backend calculation engines, frontend UI responsiveness, and offline sync integrity.

## Scope
- Unit tests, integration tests, end-to-end user flow validations, and performance budgeting.

## SSOT
- `HEALTH IS ALL/06_QA/QA_TEST_STRATEGY.mdux`

## Definitions
- **Test Coverage Threshold:** Minimum 85% code coverage requirement across all core calculation engines.

## Runtime
- Continuous Integration (CI) pipeline and local development test runners.

## Rules
1. Every new dynamic formula must include randomized boundary test cases.
2. Performance regressions exceeding 50ms execution time fail the CI build automatically.

## State
- `TestRunStatus`: PASSED | FAILED | SKIPPED | RUNNING

## Event
- `Event:CIBuildTriggered`: Initiates automated test suite execution.

## Example
- Running automated integration tests to verify nutrition calculation accuracy under extreme caloric inputs.

## Exception
- Flaky network-dependent tests are isolated and re-run up to 3 times before failing the pipeline.

